      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I mwaka ma lawimony madit ma Cargon kabaka me Aciria ocwalo obino i Acidod, olwenyo i kom jone, ci omayo gaŋ woko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "i kare meno Rwot onoŋo yam omiyo Icaya wod pa Amoj otito lokke kun wacci “Cit igony boŋo cola woko ki i pyeri, ka igony war woko bene ki i tyeni.” Ci en ocito otimo kit meno, odoŋ munero ma war bene pe i tyene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yam Rwot dok owacci, “Kit macalo laticca Icaya owoto munero, kun tyene bene tye noŋo, pi mwaka adek kulu pi nyuto gin ma bitimme i kom jo Ejipt ki jo Etiopia ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kit meno bene kabaka me Aciria bitero jo Ejipt woko i opii, ki jo Etiopia bene; bitero jo matino ki jo madito kun giwoto munero, ma tyengi bene noŋo tye noŋo, ki dudgi nono tye nono, ma meno aye bikelo lewic i Ejipt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meno bibalo cwinygi woko, lewic bene bimakogi pi Etiopia ma yam onoŋo gigeno, ki pi Ejipt ma onoŋo yam ginyatte pire-ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I nino meno jo ma bedo i dog nam gibiwacci, ‘Koŋ doŋ wunen gin ma otimme i kom jo ma yam wageno, ma yam wariŋo walaro botgi wek gukonywa, wek bene gularwa ki i ciŋ kabaka me Aciria. Ci man doŋ wabibwot niŋniŋ?’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
